\", Slot[2]]]]]], Rule[Tooltip, None]]\\) that do not match dimensions \\!\\(\
\\*RowBox[{\\\"4\\\"}]\\), listed in Bott periodicity table. Conversion \
to/from matrix representation may need adjusting the option \\\"gaFieldFactor\
\\\" value. These representations are inapropriate for non-diagonalizable MVs\
